      "text": "[8:57PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nOtedola Bridge to Berger Oke, Kara, and OPIC is good traffic flow in both directions.\n\nIsheri Olowora to Omole Junction (via River Valley, Kosoko, VIS, and Omole Gate) is fast-moving traffic.\nWempco to Odo Eran and Caterpillar is good movement in both directions.\n\nMovement towards Excellence, Yaya Abaton, Kayode, and adjoining roads is good traffic movement. \nWempco to Lateef Jakande, connecting Omole Junction, Omole Gate, VIS, River Valley, and Isheri Olowora is fast-moving traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
