      "text": "[9:09PM] #Sangotedo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdo Badore Road to Alesh and Abraham Adesanya is good movement in both directions.\nAbraham Adesanya to Ogombo Road is smooth traffic flow in both directions.\nLekki Gardens Phase 2 to DKK Supermarket (via Alasia, LBS, Sangotedo, Ogidan, and Jonaith Bridge) is smooth ride.\nDKK to ShopRite (via Peace Garden Estate turning) is good traffic movement.\nShopRite to Eleko Junction (via Majeek, Abijo, Awoyaya School Gate, Lakowe, Bogije, and Frajend) is good traffic flow in both directions.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
