      "text": "[9:21PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Abule Ado through under bridge, volks, Afolabi Ege to Iyana Iba . The intersection is a little bit busy due to commercial activities . \n\nFrom Iyana Iba intersection enroute Igando through First Gate ,Iyana School to Obadore bridge is okay, likewise the return journey.\n\nIn and out of Igbo Elerin is good.\nAfolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri road is better. \n\nGood movement along Badagry Expressway from Iyana Iba inward Agbara through Igbo Elerin junction, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era down to Custom check point.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
