      "text": "[9:30PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is free along the service lane, Anthony inward journey to Maryland intersection, and onwards Odo'yalaro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nThe entire stretch of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way is good.\n\nTraffic is also calm along Kodesoh Road, Oba Akran Road/Bridge, Local Airport Road/Bridge, Oba Akinjobi Way, and Ikeja G.R.A.\n\nOur personnel are effectively controlling traffic at their respective locations, ensuring a smooth flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
